OL,3,GNEWSAMan restrained partner with bag
OL,4,Abefore murder, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "jealous" partner used a Tesco
OL,7,Fshopping bag to restrain his girlfriend
OL,8,Fbefore raping and murdering her after
OL,9,Fshe wanted to end the relationship, a
OL,10,Fjury has heard.
OL,12,FStephen Sexton, 39, is standing trial
OL,13,Fat Winchester Crown Court accused of
OL,14,Fkilling Joanna Derkacz at her home in
OL,15,FWaterlooville, Hampshire, in December
OL,16,F2023.
OL,18,FProsecutors said Sexton displayed
OL,19,Fjealous and controlling behaviour
OL,20,Fduring what they described as a toxic
OL,21,Fand abusive relationship.
